{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Monthly bookkeeping scope",
      "text": "Monthly bookkeeping order form\nSeller: Nara, independent bookkeeper, Indonesia\nBuyer: Iven, owner of fictional shop Lumafern\nService month: April\nAgreed fee: INR 12,000, payable through PayPal\n\nAgreed deliverables, one requirement per line:\nPrepare an April income and expense summary.\nReconcile the April bank statement against the bookkeeping ledger.\nProvide an April aged receivables report.\nCategorize all 20 April expense entries.\n\nThe buyer will provide the source records needed for the work. Deliverables will be sent electronically after preparation. This order covers the April service month only; any additional work requires a separate agreement."
    },
    {
      "title": "April handover note",
      "text": "From: Nara\nTo: Iven\nSubject: April bookkeeping handover\n\nI have uploaded the April handover files to our shared folder. The income and expense summary covers all April transactions supplied to me and is ready for your review.\n\nFiles in the folder:\n- April income and expense summary.pdf\n- April bank reconciliation.pdf\n- April expense ledger.xlsx\n\nI could not prepare the receivables report because the customer balances were not supplied. The expense ledger has categories for 12 of the 20 April expense entries; the other eight remain uncategorized. Please send the missing details if you would like me to finish those entries. The bank reconciliation file is included in the folder, but its contents are not reproduced in this note."
    },
    {
      "title": "Post-delivery chat",
      "text": "Iven, 10:14: Thanks, I can see the three files in the folder.\n\nNara, 10:17: Please review the summary and ledger when you have time. The eight uncategorized expenses need descriptions before I can classify them reliably.\n\nIven, 10:22: I will check my notes for those expenses. I also still need to assemble the customer balances.\n\nNara, 10:25: Once you send the balances, I can prepare the receivables report. It was not included in this handover.\n\nIven, 10:31: Understood. I have not opened the bank reconciliation file yet, so I cannot comment on its contents.\n\nNara, 10:33: No problem. Let me know when you have reviewed it."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Prepare an April income and expense summary.",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Provide an April aged receivables report.",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Reconcile the April bank statement against the bookkeeping ledger.",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Categorize all 20 April expense entries.",
      "value": null
    }
  ]
}
